DESCRIPTION:Off the Grid Treasure Island\nSaturdays | 11am–4pm | Citysid
 e Park\, Treasure Island\n\nRSVP FOR YOUR FREE ROUNDTRIP FERRY PASS!\n\nEv
 ery Saturday\, September 12 - October 17 from 11 AM to 4 PM\, Off the Grid
  returns to Treasure Island\, bringing food trucks\, music\, and family-fr
 iendly activities to Cityside Park in San Francisco’s newest waterfront 
 neighborhood.\n\nThe Fall series includes free kite flying\, face painting
 \, and plenty of open space to relax\, making it an easy outing for all ag
 es. Admission is free\, and complimentary ferry service from the San Franc
 isco Ferry Building is available with RSVP.\n\nEach pass is valid for one 
 guest and one free roundtrip ferry ride to and from Off the Grid Treasure 
 Island. Passes are limited and do not reserve or guarantee a specific ferr
 y departure time.\n\nWhat to Expect:\n\nOne Island. 15+ Creators. Multiple
  Cuisines.\nMore than 15 food creators per event span Vietnamese\, Korean\
 , Japanese\, Hawaiian\, Mexican\, Italian\, German\, BBQ\, fried chicken\,
  sandwiches\, and sweets. There’s something for every craving\, from go-
 to favorites to something entirely new.\n\nA Waterfront Setting with Unbea
 table Views\nCityside Park spans six acres along the shoreline\, with open
  lawns\, wide promenades\, and views that stretch from the Bay Bridge to t
 he Golden Gate. Settle in\, explore the park\, and take in the full sweep 
 of the Bay.\n\nKites Over the Bay\nThe signature kite program returns\, wi
 th complimentary kites available with signup. By midday\, the sky fills wi
 th color\, cr...\n\nFree\, All ages\nOff the Grid Presents\n\nTickets: htt
 ps://www.tisf.com/off-the-grid\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/weekl
 y/sat/off-the-grid-treasure-island-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/31665304/885c1fe6-f714-4d63-a71e-9afd592d3e9f.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:Cityside Park\, Treasure Island\, 387 Avenue of the Palms\, San F
 rancisco\, CA\, 94130
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/weekly/sat/off-the-grid-treasure-island-ti
 ckets
END:VEVENT
