DESCRIPTION:Sunday\, October 18\, 2026\, 4:30 pm - 9:30 pm\n35 Top Restaur
 ants• 4-Course Feast •\n1 Unforgettable Evening\nJoin Foodwise for our
  most important night of the year\, bringing together farmers\, chefs\, an
 d change makers⁠ in supporting a just\, regenerative\, and delicious foo
 d future. At Sunday Supper: A Farm to City Feast\, you’ll enjoy an abund
 ant walkaround reception and elegant seated four-course dinner at San Fran
 cisco’s iconic Ferry Building\, showcasing the freshest fall produce fro
 m Foodwise’s farmers markets. Support local farms\, community food acces
 s\, and youth education\, and do it deliciously.\n\nOpening Reception\nKic
 k off the night with hors d’oeuvres\, hand-crafted drinks\, and a behind
 -the-scenes peek at the action-packed kitchen.\n\nFour-Course Feast\nGathe
 r in the Grand Hall as the city’s top chefs present unforgettable menus 
 using the season’s bounty\, paired with specially selected California wi
 nes.\n\nLive Auction\nTake home one-of-a-kind packages such as exquisite p
 rivate dinners with acclaimed chefs\, luxurious getaways\, and exclusive f
 ood experiences.\n\nNew this year! We’ve added a limited number of recep
 tion-only tickets\, so that more guests can enjoy the lavish hors d’oeuv
 res and hand-crafted drinks. The reception will take place in front of the
  Ferry Building from 4:30 to 6:00 pm (seated four-course dinner not includ
 ed).\n\nA Gala for a Cause\nProceeds provide vital funds for Foodwise’s 
 work championing an equitable and sustainable Bay Area food community thro
 ugh farmers market...\n\n$175-$400 | 21+\nFoodwise presents:\n\nTickets: h
 ttps://foodwisesundaysupper2026.eventbrite.com/\nDetails: https://dothebay
 .com/events/2026/10/18/foodwise-sunday-supper-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
